text.en:
Section 1 of the Architects, Professional Engineers and Quantity Surveyors Order, 201 1, in this Order referred to as the principal Order, is amended, in

(a) by deleting "and quantity surveyors" from the third line and by ", quantity surveyors and building draughtsmen" therefor;

(b) by deleting "and quantity surveyors" from the fourth and fifth lines and by substituting ", quantity surveyors and building draughtsmen"
